From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Druchenko <bananos@dev.co.ua>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:25:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] b43: N-PHY: radio 2057 rev 13 (BCM5357/53572)

Add what radio 2057 rev 13 on N-PHY rev 17 needs, next to rev 14:
the radio init table, the 2.4 GHz channel table (channels 1-13), the
iPA TX gain table, antenna switch LUT type 1, and the rev 13 values in
radio setup, RCAL, the RC calibration overrides and the iPA workarounds.
Limit the band to channels 1-13 as for rev 9 and 14.

All values are derived from the register writes of the wl 5.110.27
driver on an ASUS RT-N12 D1, logged at its PHY/radio/table accessors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/main.c      |   7 +-
 drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/phy_n.c     |  37 +++++-
 .../net/wireless/broadcom/b43/radio_2057.c    | 113 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../net/wireless/broadcom/b43/tables_nphy.c   |  54 +++++++++
 4 files changed, 204 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/main.c b/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/main.c
